0..76 Comment "//! Capability attenuation, after the object-capability discipline of Dennis"
77..162 Comment "//! and Van Horn [Dennis-1966-programming_semantics_for_multiprogrammed_computations]"
163..243 Comment "//! and of Miller\'s thesis, 2006: a capability holding more operations is passed"
